# THE FOLD — nepooloperator.com SUNSET (2026-07-16, refined 2026-07-22)
# NEPOOL Operator is folded into Array Operator as Invoices → Generation reports.
# User-facing routes 301 to arrayoperator.com deep-linked into that subtab.
# Netlify forwards query strings on 301s, so old magic-link emails
# (…/accounts/?token=…) land on arrayoperator.com/accounts/?token=… where the
# same proxied SPA exchanges them.
#
# KEPT as 200 proxies (do not remove yet):
#   /v1/*    — the PUBLISHED Chrome extension (pre-v1.9.123) still POSTs
#              captures to nepooloperator.com/v1/sync. A 301 across a POST
#              drops the body. Remove only after the v1.9.123 Web Store
#              publish has been live for a few weeks.
#   /admin/* + /health — Ford's ops boards / probes (arrayoperator.com does
#              not proxy /admin).
# Map: CC/nepool-fold/MAP.md · memory nepool-fold-into-ao
#
# Deep link note: Netlify _redirects cannot carry a URL hash, so we land on
# ?from=nepool and Array Operator's index.html rewrites that to
# #reports/generation (Invoices → Generation reports).
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Still-proxied machine routes (order matters: first match wins) ───────
/v1/*        https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/v1/:splat     200
/admin/*     https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/admin/:splat  200
/admin       https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/admin         200
/health      https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/health        200

# ── User-facing routes → Array Operator (auth / onboarding / legal stay) ─
/accounts      https://arrayoperator.com/accounts          301!
/accounts/*    https://arrayoperator.com/accounts/:splat   301!
/onboarding    https://arrayoperator.com/onboarding        301!
/onboarding/*  https://arrayoperator.com/onboarding        301!
/signup        https://arrayoperator.com/onboarding        301!
/signup.html   https://arrayoperator.com/onboarding        301!
/get-started   https://arrayoperator.com/onboarding        301!
/privacy       https://arrayoperator.com/privacy           301!
/privacy.html  https://arrayoperator.com/privacy           301!
/login         https://arrayoperator.com/login             301!
/login/*       https://arrayoperator.com/login             301!

# Everything else (landing page included) → Generation reports subtab.
# ?from=nepool is rewritten client-side to #reports/generation.
/*             https://arrayoperator.com/?from=nepool      301!
